# A distortion code we do not know, 'RA---TAN-XYZ' / 'DEC--TAN-XYZ', on a
# header that carries SIP keywords (synthetic, from the round-3 verifier
# probe p41_sip_unknown_dist). wcslib 8.10 accepts it and applies SIP (the
# SIP keywords alone make SIP the prior distortion; the unknown code is
# ignored). The CTYPE declares a distortion we cannot apply, so we refuse.
# AP/BP are given so hdr2sky injects nothing.
# EXPECT-GO-ERROR: unsupported distortion "XYZ" in CTYPE
NOTE stricter: sip_unknown_dist_code
GRID 1 1024 9 1 1024 9
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 1024
NAXIS2  = 1024
CRVAL1  = 150.0
CRVAL2  = 2.0
CRPIX1  = 512.5
CRPIX2  = 512.5
CTYPE1  = 'RA---TAN-XYZ'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TAN-XYZ'
CD1_1   = -0.0002777
CD1_2   = 0.0
CD2_1   = 0.0
CD2_2   = 0.0002777
A_ORDER = 2
B_ORDER = 2
A_2_0   = 2e-5
A_1_1   = 1e-5
B_0_2   = 2e-5
B_1_1   = -1e-5
AP_ORDER= 1
AP_0_0  = 0.0
BP_ORDER= 1
BP_0_0  = 0.0
